            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"This Agreement and all rights and duties hereunder are personal to Diplomat and shall not, without the written consent of KI, Inc., be assigned, mortgaged, sublicensed or otherwise encumbered by Diplomat or by operation of law.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"KI, Inc. may assign its rights hereunder, but shall furnish written notice of such assignment to Diplomat.\",\n      \"note\": \"Diplomat is prohibited from assigning or encumbering the agreement without the prior written consent of KI, Inc., while KI, Inc. is expressly permitted to assign its rights upon written notice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"NOT_FOUND\",\n      \"quote\": null,\n      \"overrideQuote\": null,\n      \"note\": \"The agreement contains no change of control provisions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"The license hereby granted shall be exclusive as to the products described in subparagraphs 2.(a)(1) and (2) of this Agreement, but nonexclusive as to all other products covered by this Agreement.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"Nothing in this Agreement shall be construed to prevent KI, Inc. from granting any other licenses for the use of KI's name or likeness, or from utilizing KI's name and likeness in any manner whatsoever, except that KI, Inc. agrees that except as provided herein it will grant no other licenses for the territory to which this license extends for the use of KI's name and likeness in connection with the sale of the products described in subparagraphs 2.(a)(1) and (2) of this Agreement effective during the term of this Agreement.\",\n      \"note\": \"The grant of exclusivity is limited specifically to certain product categories (sunglasses, ophthalmic frames, and specific accessories sold in optical retailers) and is nonexclusive as to other products.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
